ly hub (no surface axis), zero named extensions.\",\n6:   \"discriminator\": {\n7:     \"workflowMode\": \"Public hub/mode key; stable identity used by the hub router and this registry.\",\n8:     \"packetKind\": \"Axis discriminator: workflow for all sk-doc packets (no surface packets).\",\n9:     \"backendKind\": \"template-scaffold for the create-* document generators and for the voice-application mode; create-quality-control for the validate/score/optimize-existing-doc workflow.\"\n10:   },\n11:   \"advisorRoutingContract\": {\n12:     \"routingClass\": \"metadata = resolved by hub membership (default for all sk-doc modes); command-bridge = reached only via its command, never advisor-scored. No lexical/alias-fold modes (avoids the advisor-projection extension + CI drift-guard).\",\n13:     \"command\": \"The bound slash command for the mode, recorded even on metadata-routed modes; null when the mode has no dedicated command today.\",\n14:     \"packetSkillName\": \"The packet SKILL.md name; folder == packetSkillName unless grandfatheredFolderMismatch is true.\",\n15:     \"grandfatheredFolderMismatch\": \"false for every sk-doc mode (all folders are clean create-*/ names).\"\n16:   },\n17:   \"modes\": [\n18:     {\n19:       \"workflowMode\": \"sk-create-skill\",\n20:       \"packetKind\": \"workflow\",\n21:       \"backendKind\": \"template-scaffold\",\n22:       \"toolSurface\": {\n23:         \"allowed\": [\n24:           \"Read\",\n25:           \"Write\",\n26:           \"Edit\",\n27:           \"Bash\",\n28:           \"Grep\",\n29:           \"Glob\"\n30:         ],\n31:         \"forbidden\": [\n32:           \"Task\"\n33:         ],\n34:         \"mutatesWorkspace\": true,\n35:         \"bashAllowlist\": []\n36:       },\n37:       \"packet\": \"sk-create-skill\",\n38:       \"packetSkillName\": \"sk-create-skill\",\n39:       \"grandfatheredFolderMismatch\": false,\n40:       \"command\": \"/create:skill\",\n41:       \"aliases\": [\n42:         \"cre