{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582858280,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57933f90014ZTiiUvzf4ursj","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","messageID":"msg_1d578d1e1001qbIJBNzYobgZ76","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9d4184e96590e68","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md","oldString":"\"leaf-manifest config aliases required\", \"/create:skill\"]},","newString":"\"leaf-manifest config aliases required\", \"/create:sk-skill\"]},"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\n@@ -168,9 +168,9 @@\n ```python\n INTENT_SIGNALS = {\n     \"DOC_QUALITY\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"documentation quality\", \"doc quality\", \"validate documentation\", \"validate a document\", \"validate this document\", \"validate markdown\", \"validation rules\", \"score this document\", \"score this doc\", \"dqi\", \"document audit\", \"fail sk-doc standards\", \"review the docs\", \"review the documentation\", \"document for clarity\", \"check the docs\", \"check the documentation\", \"audit the docs\", \"documentation review bar\", \"quality bar\", \"flag\", \"meet our standards\", \"audit documentation quality\", \"ai-friendly documentation\", \"extract structure\", \"validate\", \"score\", \"harden\", \"audit\", \"/doc:quality\"]},\n     \"OPTIMIZATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"optimize\", \"token efficiency\", \"llms.txt\", \"llmstxt\", \"reduce tokens\", \"fewer tokens\", \"trim\", \"compress the doc\", \"slim down\", \"model's budget\", \"machine-readable index\", \"optimize this doc\"]},\n-    \"SKILL_CREATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"sk-skill\", \"create a new sk\", \"create sk-\", \"skill.md scaffold\", \"skill.md and starter\", \"resource_map wiring\", \"new skill\", \"create a skill\", \"build a skill\", \"author a skill\", \"scaffold a skill\", \"reusable capability\", \"reusable helper\", \"starter reference docs\", \"new capability\", \"capability module\", \"package a capability\", \"create skill\", \"skill scaffold\", \"opencode skill\", \"package skill\", \"which json files does a skill need\", \"skill root metadata contract\", \"leaf-manifest config aliases required\", \"/create:skill\"]},\n+    \"SKILL_CREATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"sk-skill\", \"create a new sk\", \"create sk-\", \"skill.md scaffold\", \"skill.md and starter\", \"resource_map wiring\", \"new skill\", \"create a skill\", \"build a skill\", \"author a skill\", \"scaffold a skill\", \"reusable capability\", \"reusable helper\", \"starter reference docs\", \"new capability\", \"capability module\", \"package a capability\", \"create skill\", \"skill scaffold\", \"opencode skill\", \"package skill\", \"which json files does a skill need\", \"skill root metadata contract\", \"leaf-manifest config aliases required\", \"/create:sk-skill\"]},\n     \"PARENT_HUB\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"parent hub\", \"parent skill\", \"mode packet\", \"mode packets\", \"nested packet\", \"nested workflow packet\", \"mode-registry.json\", \"hub-router.json\", \"hub versus standalone skill class\", \"skill hub\", \"/create:skill-parent\"]},\n     \"RENDER_LEDGER\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"doc rewrite guard\", \"doc-rewrite-guard.py\", \"rewrite guard\", \"render ledger\", \"render-known-debt.json\", \"exempt from the render checks\", \"render exempt map\", \"kept every claim\", \"kept every original claim\"]},\n     \"AGENT_CREATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"create an agent\", \"create agent\", \"new agent\", \"author an agent\", \"scaffold an agent\", \"agent file\", \"agent persona\", \"agent frontmatter\", \"agent template\", \"permission object\", \"authority boundary\", \"@analyze agent\", \"opencode agent\", \"claude code agent\", \"/create:agent\"]},\n     \"COMMAND_CREATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"create a command\", \"create command\", \"slash command\", \"new slash command\", \"author a command\", \"scaffold a command\", \"argument-hint\", \"allowed-tools\", \"command template\", \"router presentation split\", \"thin router\", \"presentation contract\", \"opencode command\", \"$arguments\", \"/create:command\"]},\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\", \"oldString\": \"\\\"leaf-manifest config aliases required\\\", \\\"/create:skill\\\"]},\", \"newString\": \"\\\"leaf-manifest config aliases required\\\", \\\"/create:sk-skill\\\"]},\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582852601,"end":1794582858280}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582858286,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57940c6001nhzSmroNT5vHeq","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","messageID":"msg_1d578d1e1001qbIJBNzYobgZ76","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b90b77dd59aa8e0b","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md","oldString":"| **sk-create-skill** | Scaffold an OpenCode skill (and, via `sk-create-skill-parent`, a parent hub with nested mode packets) | `sk-create-skill/` | `/create:skill`, `/create:skill-parent` |","newString":"| **sk-create-skill** | Scaffold an OpenCode skill (and, via `sk-create-skill-parent`, a parent hub with nested mode packets) | `sk-create-skill/` | `/create:sk-skill`, `/create:skill-parent` |"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md\n@@ -25,9 +25,9 @@\n Use this skill for documentation and OpenCode-component authoring, and for document-quality work. The hub classifies the request, resolves a `workflowMode`, and loads the matching nested packet.\n \n | Mode | Use it for | Packet | Command |\n |------|------------|--------|---------|\n-| **sk-create-skill** | Scaffold an OpenCode skill (and, via `sk-create-skill-parent`, a parent hub with nested mode packets) | `sk-create-skill/` | `/create:skill`, `/create:skill-parent` |\n+| **sk-create-skill** | Scaffold an OpenCode skill (and, via `sk-create-skill-parent`, a parent hub with nested mode packets) | `sk-create-skill/` | `/create:sk-skill`, `/create:skill-parent` |\n | **sk-create-readme** | Author a folder README, general or code-folder | `sk-create-readme/` | `/create:readme` |\n | **sk-create-agent** | Scaffold an OpenCode agent (permission/authority frontmatter) | `sk-create-agent/` | `/create:agent` |\n | **sk-create-command** | Scaffold an OpenCode slash command (argument-hint + allowed-tools + router/presentation split) | `sk-create-command/` | `/create:command` |\n | **sk-create-feature-catalog** | Author a feature-catalog inventory package | `sk-create-feature-catalog/` | `/create:feature-catalog` |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md\", \"oldString\": \"| **sk-create-skill** | Scaffold an OpenCode skill (and, via `sk-create-skill-parent`, a parent hub with nested mode packets) | `sk-create-skill/` | `/create:skill`, `/create:skill-parent` |\", \"newString\": \"| **sk-create-skill** | Scaffold an OpenCode skill (and, via `sk-create-skill-parent`, a parent hub with nested mode packets) | `sk-create-skill/` | `/create:sk-skill`, `/create:skill-parent` |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582855878,"end":1794582858286}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582858291,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5794835001eYkLz7snPjOcEO","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","messageID":"msg_1d578d1e1001qbIJBNzYobgZ76","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-91f39965db510970","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md","oldString":"and the `/create:skill` and `/create:agent` workflow assets all point","newString":"and the `/create:sk-skill` and `/create:agent` workflow assets all point"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md\n@@ -141,9 +141,9 @@\n - **sk-doc parent hub.** This packet is registered in `../mode-registry.json` and `../hub-router.json`. The advisor scores the hub on `../graph-metadata.json`, so every keyword trigger above is also a stage-one entry there. A trigger present in one of the three and absent from another routes on one stage only.\n - **Shared-tier enforcement.** `../shared/scripts/quick_validate.py` reads the description budget from `../shared/assets/skill-contract.json`, `../shared/scripts/frontmatter-version.mjs` implements the versioning standard, and `../shared/scripts/check-frontmatter-versions.sh` wraps its `gate` mode. This mode owns what they check, and never edits how.\n - **Value lists.** `assets/frontmatter-values.json` holds the `contextType` and `importance_tier` values and aliases. spec-kit's `shared/context-types.ts` and `FRONTMATTER_VALUES` rule, `../shared/scripts/validate_document.py` and the skill-advisor `check-skill-doc-frontmatter.mjs` read it by path, so moving or reshaping it breaks all four.\n - **Post-edit hook.** `.skilled/hooks/post-edit-quality/` resolves the corpus gate by literal path on every qualifying edit. That path is why the scripts stay in the shared tier.\n-- **Templates that cite this contract.** `sk-create-skill`'s manifest, reference and asset templates, the feature-catalog and playbook templates, and the `/create:skill` and `/create:agent` workflow assets all point at `assets/frontmatter-templates.md`. A rule changed here changes what they emit.\n+- **Templates that cite this contract.** `sk-create-skill`'s manifest, reference and asset templates, the feature-catalog and playbook templates, and the `/create:sk-skill` and `/create:agent` workflow assets all point at `assets/frontmatter-templates.md`. A rule changed here changes what they emit.\n - **Doctor budget audit.** `/doctor:skill-advisor skill-budget` and `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/audit_descriptions.py` measure the project against the budget this contract documents.\n \n ---\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md\", \"oldString\": \"and the `/create:skill` and `/create:agent` workflow assets all point\", \"newString\": \"and the `/create:sk-skill` and `/create:agent` workflow assets all point\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582857781,"end":1794582858291}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582858296,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5793bc8001Zcf2qCgPF45MOJ","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","messageID":"msg_1d578d1e1001qbIJBNzYobgZ76","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a421b351afdf35db","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md","oldString":"You reach it through thirteen `/create:*` commands: `/create:agent`, `/create:skill`, `/create:skill-parent`, `/create:command`,","newString":"You reach it through thirteen `/create:*` commands: `/create:agent`, `/create:sk-skill`, `/create:skill-parent`, `/create:command`,"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md\n@@ -63,9 +63,9 @@\n ### When To Use This Skill\n \n Reach for sk-doc when you create or edit a markdown document, when you scaffold a skill, an agent, a command or another OpenCode component and when you need a quality gate before publishing. Use it when you build a feature catalog, a testing playbook, a flowchart, a changelog, a spec packet goal or a before/after diff of an edited document. Use it too when a document's DQI score drops and you need to know what to fix and why.\n \n-You reach it through thirteen `/create:*` commands: `/create:agent`, `/create:skill`, `/create:skill-parent`, `/create:command`, `/create:feature-catalog`, `/create:manual-testing-playbook`, `/create:benchmark`, `/create:readme`, `/create:changelog`, `/create:diff`, `/create:repo-rule`, `/create:with-human-voice` and `/create:goal`. The `@markdown` agent handles template-first documentation authoring for these and other markdown targets.\n+You reach it through thirteen `/create:*` commands: `/create:agent`, `/create:sk-skill`, `/create:skill-parent`, `/create:command`, `/create:feature-catalog`, `/create:manual-testing-playbook`, `/create:benchmark`, `/create:readme`, `/create:changelog`, `/create:diff`, `/create:repo-rule`, `/create:with-human-voice` and `/create:goal`. The `@markdown` agent handles template-first documentation authoring for these and other markdown targets.\n \n Skip sk-doc when the task belongs to a neighbor:\n \n - Code changes route to `sk-code`.\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md\", \"oldString\": \"You reach it through thirteen `/create:*` commands: `/create:agent`, `/create:skill`, `/create:skill-parent`, `/create:command`,\", \"newString\": \"You reach it through thirteen `/create:*` commands: `/create:agent`, `/create:sk-skill`, `/create:skill-parent`, `/create:command`,\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582854600,"end":1794582858296}}}}
