{"type":"text","timestamp":1794582955172,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","part":{"id":"prt_1d57ab83f002WXDSU2tohFioXU","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffep6y7sQ71Rop5Va","messageID":"msg_1d57aa5f1001NQ5eNAqeqHSfaq","type":"text","text":"T006 is complete. The sk-doc hub now names `/create:sk-skill` in all eight files, with 11 replacements and no version field touched. The task checkbox is left unticked.\n\nFiles written:\n1. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json`\n2. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json`\n3. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json`\n4. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md`\n5. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md`\n6. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md`\n7. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-command/assets/command-contract.json`\n8. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-frontmatter/SKILL.md`\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\nOLD scan exit=1 (1 means no matches)\njq empty exit=0\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nOK: parent-skill-check — all hard invariants passed, 0 warnings\nall 7 hubs resolve\nall 55 served copies match their authored files\n```\n\n`git diff` on the eight files shows 11 insertions and 11 deletions, all old-name substitutions. Nothing was blocked and nothing is left undone.","time":{"start":1794582951999,"end":1794582955172}}}
